## Analytics

The site uses privacy-focused Umami analytics in JavaScript. An interactive browser or agent can append `?analytics=off` to any site URL once to disable analytics for that browser. Append `?analytics=on` to re-enable it. Most crawlers that do not execute JavaScript are not recorded by Umami.
